# TMDB API Configuration (for Vite)
# Get your free API key from: https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api

# Add this to .env.local (create file if it doesn't exist)
VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Example (DO NOT USE THIS - it's fake):
# VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9.eyJhdWQiOiIxMjM0NTY3ODkwIiwic3ViIjoiMTIzNDU2Nzg5MCIsInNjb3BlIjpbInJlYWQiXSwiaWF0IjoxNTE2MjM5MDIyfQ

# How to setup:
# 1. Go to https://www.themoviedb.org/settings/api
# 2. Create free account and login
# 3. Click "Create" or "Generate" for API key
# 4. Copy your API key (v3 Auth Token)
# 5. Create .env.local in project root
# 6. Paste: VITE_TMDB_API_KEY=your_key_here
# 7. Restart dev server: npm run dev
# 8. Done! ✨

# Note: .env.local is in .gitignore - never commit your API key!
# Note: Uses VITE_ prefix (not REACT_APP_) because this is a Vite project
